<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>FAQ | STREETKICKS</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/responsive.css">
</head>

<body>

<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">

        <a href="/" class="logo">STREETKICKS</a>

        <nav class="main-nav">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=new">New Arrivals</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=collections">Collections</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=deals">Deals</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="/shop">⌕</a>
            <a href="/wishlist">♡</a>
            <a href="/cart">🛒</a>

            <button id="theme-toggle" type="button">☾</button>

            <button class="menu-toggle" type="button">☰</button>
        </div>

    </div>
</header>

<main>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="hero-label">NEED HELP?</span>
        <h1>FAQ</h1>
        <p>Frequently asked questions.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">

<div class="container">

    <div class="faq-list">

        <details>
            <summary>How do I place an order?</summary>

            <p>
                Browse the Shop page, select a product, choose your
                preferred size and add the product to your cart.
                Proceed to checkout when you are ready.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How can I check my order?</summary>

            <p>
                Visit the My Account section and open your orders
                to view available order information.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Can I return an item?</summary>

            <p>
                Returns are subject to the STREETKICKS return policy.
                Visit the Returns page for more information.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>

            <p>
                Delivery time depends on your location and courier
                availability.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How do I choose my sneaker size?</summary>

            <p>
                Visit our Size Guide for a general size reference
                and foot measurement instructions.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Can I save products for later?</summary>

            <p>
                Yes. Products can be added to your Wishlist so you
                can easily find them again.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How can I contact STREETKICKS?</summary>

            <p>
                Visit our Contact Us page to find our contact
                information and send us a message.
            </p>
        </details>

    </div>

</div>

</section>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <p>&copy; 2026 STREETKICKS. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</footer>

<script src="/js/theme.js"></script>

</body>
</html>